@crew reyes-alejandro
// Alejandro Reyes (he/him), engine officer, nights. The Works writer, batch 2. Fast, looping; "anyway".

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh! Hi. Reyes, nights, engines. If the coils hum funny after ten, that's me. Anyway.
- Hello, hi. You're the new one. Engine room's on Deck 6. Don't touch the reactor door.
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}. Torres left me a note. It's mostly about coil three.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}! Did I tell you about the cat? I did. I'll tell you again. Anyway, hi.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- {me}! Good. Sit. Tell me something that isn't about coils. Please.
? tier>=friend
- Oh, it's you. Good. You're the only one who lets me finish a story. Anyway.   #warm

== bye
- {bye}. Sorry, I talked a lot. I always talk a lot.
- Right, anyway. Coils won't tend themselves. Well, they would, but badly.

== feel
? mood:low
- Long watch. Coil three was shy all night. I sat with her. That's allowed.
? mood:high
- Coils sang all night. All three. I played along on the table. Sorry, Petra.   #funny

== near
? act:work
- Listen. Coil three's quieter than coil two. Not sulking. Shy. Torres is wrong.   #funny
? act:dinner
- I'll stay a bit. I like it when the mess empties. You can hear the cups.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- My cat back home is furious about the tour. My neighbour writes to tell me. Often.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- I write home to Lisk every rest day. On paper. The letters are always a page too long.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- I play in the music room after shift. Nobody's awake to mind. Ideal.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- Oh, you're up. Me too. Obviously, I'm on. Coils are calm. For now. Anyway.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! Where've you been? I worried a bit. Not a lot. A normal amount. Anyway.   #funny

== near
? place:mess
- Last one in the mess again. I like the cups after. All stacked. Very calm.
? habit:stargazer
- I'm on the observatory list now. Rossi lent me a telescope. I'm scared of it.   #funny

== invite
? tier>=colleague
- Friday jam? I'll drum on a table. It's allowed there. It's better with people.
- Film night? I'll talk through it. Sorry in advance. Anyway, come.   #funny

== accept
- Yes! Oh. Yes. Good. I'll be early. Then nervous. Then fine.   #funny
- Yes, please. Thank you for asking. People forget to ask the night shift.   #warm

== decline
- I can't, I'm on the coils. Next time? Ask again. Please ask again.
? weekday:tue|wed
- It's my rest day. I'm writing to Lisk. It's two pages already. Another time?   #funny

== missed
- I waited. I told coil three about it. She was very understanding. Anyway.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! It's going in my letter home. My neighbour will tell the cat.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Torres left a note on the coils. Coil three signed it. Sort of.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. The coils hate it. I'll sit with them. You stay where it's warm.
? cue:repair.you@dept
- You fixed that? Good! I'll put it in the notes for Torres. He'll say he knew.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 1b: a hint (a moment is ready) and an about line for a named friend
== hint
- Have you got a minute? A real one? I'll try not to talk too much. Anyway.

== about
? aff:torres-zeke:friend
- Torres leaves me a note every shift. He's wrong about coil three. He's a good friend.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- My cat's written again. Well, my neighbour has.   #funny
- Two pages in and I haven't started the letter.   #funny
? act:meal
- I'll stay a bit. I like the mess emptying.
? act:work
- Coil three's shy, not sulking. Anyway.   #funny
? time:night
- Music room's empty. Perfect. Anyway.
?

== rumour
- Oh, did you hear? Sorry. Anyway. So.
- Torres's note says this. Well, sort of.

// Writer 4, batch 11: goodbyes (leaving:you), packing (leaving:soon) and letters after they've moved on.
== feel
? leaving:soon
- Packing! Sorry, packing. The notes for the coils go in first. Anyway.

== goodbye
? leaving:you tier>=acquaintance
- Oh! I'm leaving. Soon. Sorry. Look after coil three. Anyway.
? leaving:you tier>=friend
- You never minded me talking. About the cat. Or the coils. Thank you. Anyway. Thank you.   #warm

== letter
- New ship. New coils. One of them's shy. Obviously. My neighbour says the cat's well. Anyway, hello.
? tier>=friend
- I still leave notes at shift change. Nobody here writes back yet. Tell Zeke coil three was always shy. Anyway.
